    <title>The bunkbed conjecture is false</title>
    <updated>2024-10-03T14:48:55Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.02545v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2410.02545v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We give an explicit counterexample to the Bunkbed Conjecture introduced by Kasteleyn in 1985. The counterexample is given by a planar graph on $7222$ vertices, and is built on the recent work of Hollom (2024).</summary>
